  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Women&apos;s Response Rooms (WRRs)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Women&#x2019;s Response Rooms (WRRs) were established to strengthen women&#x2019;s
leadership within the Emergency Response Rooms (ERR) movement, foster
community and shared learning among women, and respond to women&#x2019;s specific
humanitarian needs. WRRs are especially critical in contexts where women carry
primary responsibility for family survival, resources are scarce, and many women
are survivors of gender-based violence. P2H supports the ERRs as well as the WRRs to meet urgent humanitarian needs through this programme.</narrative>
  </description>
